sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as React Client
    participant Guard as JWT Guard
    participant Service as Rec Service
    participant Ranker as PyTorch Ranker
    participant DB as MongoDB

    Client->>Guard: GET /personalized-recommendations (Bearer JWT)
    Guard->>Service: Token Validated (extract user_id)
    Service->>DB: Fetch reading_history & reactions
    DB-->>Service: User Interaction History
    Service->>DB: Fetch unread candidates (Compound Index)
    DB-->>Service: Candidate Stories
    Note over Service: Compute Softmax Attention & 1159-d Vector
    Service->>Ranker: Batch MLP Inference (1159-d Input)
    Ranker-->>Service: P(click) Prediction Scores
    Note over Service: Greedy ILD Reranker Execution
    Service-->>Client: HTTP 200 OK (JSON Feed + Transparent AI Rationales)
